  partName: Fan Blades
  description: The Front Cap is a compact, tiny component located at the middle-center-rear
    of the jet engine, made from the front fan material. It plays a crucial role
    in enclosing the front section of the engine, protecting internal components
    from external factors. Interestingly, its compact design allows for minimal obstruction
    of airflow into the engine.
